          <div class="bg-purple-500 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">📍</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900">All {nearbyHikes.length} Trails Near New Haven</h2>
